- Read AGENTS.md and docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md before starting work.
- Follow the current-day scope in docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md.
- Day 3 is planning only; do not write feature code until trainer approval is recorded.
- Before Task List implementation, review docs/REQUIREMENTS.md, docs/DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/DECISIONS.md.
- Preserve current Kotlin Android conventions and avoid unapproved UI toolkit changes.
- Keep the first Task List implementation scoped to the approved screen; no backend or durable persistence unless approved.
- Record actual build, test and runtime results in docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md.
